capability admit-api-run-live
intent: Admit a run of a declared capability through the declared API and run it asynchronously: the run store of the sfx-identity database registers it under the caller session (an idempotencyKey in the admission names the same run for the same caller), and the answer instructs the hosting facade to answer 202 with the run and to execute the run on a worker kernel that streams its observations, then completes it through complete-api-run. A replayed key answers the run it admitted without executing it again.
outcome: a host directive (application/vnd.sfx.host-directive+json): execute-run with the 202 answer, the observe envelope and the completion, or respond for a replayed key; a refused registration answers its refusal
inquiry: Which run did this admission create, and how does the host execute it?
input contract admit-api-run-live-request.v1 {"type":"object"}
output contract admit-api-run-live-result.v1 {"type":"object"}
cli display outcome as json
scenario admit-api-run-live root terminal
given: an admission (object, operation, subject, namespace, input, idempotencyKey) with the caller principal and session
when: the run store registers the run
then: the outcome is the host directive for the registered run
operation admit-api-run-live.register-prepare kind invoke-port port admit-api-run-live-register-prepare
operation admit-api-run-live.register kind invoke-port port admit-api-run-live-register
operation admit-api-run-live.answer kind invoke-port port admit-api-run-live-answer
platform bind admit-api-run-live-register-prepare
platform: sda-authority-transformation-port.v1
config: {"expression":{"op":"object","fields":{"executionTarget":{"op":"literal","value":"sql-database-reader"},"executionNamespace":{"op":"literal","value":"sidefx:capabilities"},"executionScenario":{"op":"literal","value":"sql-database-reader"},"inputType":{"op":"literal","value":"json"},"dispatchRequest":{"op":"object","fields":{"dataSource":{"op":"literal","value":"sfx-identity-database"},"statement":{"op":"literal","value":"SET NOCOUNT ON; DECLARE @principal_id uniqueidentifier = TRY_CONVERT(uniqueidentifier, JSON_VALUE(@input, '$.principalId')); DECLARE @session_id uniqueidentifier = TRY_CONVERT(uniqueidentifier, JSON_VALUE(@input, '$.sessionId')); DECLARE @object nvarchar(64) = COALESCE(JSON_VALUE(@input, '$.admission.object'), N'capability'); DECLARE @operation nvarchar(64) = COALESCE(JSON_VALUE(@input, '$.admission.operation'), N'observe'); DECLARE @capability_id nvarchar(512) = JSON_VALUE(@input, '$.admission.subject'); DECLARE @namespace_id nvarchar(256) = COALESCE(JSON_VALUE(@input, '$.admission.namespace'), N'sidefx:capabilities'); DECLARE @key nvarchar(4000) = JSON_VALUE(@input, '$.admission.idempotencyKey'); IF @object <> N'capability' OR @operation NOT IN (N'observe', N'invoke') OR @capability_id IS NULL OR LEN(@capability_id) = 0 THROW 51000, 'ADMISSION_INVALID', 1; IF @key IS NOT NULL AND (LEN(@key) = 0 OR LEN(@key) > 200) THROW 51000, 'IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_INVALID', 1; DECLARE @run_id varchar(128) = CASE WHEN @key IS NULL THEN LOWER(CONVERT(varchar(36), NEWID())) ELSE LOWER(CONVERT(varchar(36), CONVERT(uniqueidentifier, SUBSTRING(HASHBYTES('SHA2_256', CONCAT(N'sfx-api-admission:', CONVERT(nvarchar(36), @principal_id), N':', @key)), 1, 16)))) END; DECLARE @before datetime2(7) = SYSUTCDATETIME(); DECLARE @r TABLE(run_id varchar(128), admitted_at datetime2(7)); BEGIN TRY INSERT @r EXEC evidence.register_run @run_id = @run_id, @principal_id = @principal_id, @session_id = @session_id, @capability_id = @capability_id, @namespace_id = @namespace_id, @writer_id = 'sfx-api'; END TRY BEGIN CATCH IF ERROR_MESSAGE() = 'EVIDENCE_CONFLICT' AND @key IS NOT NULL THROW 51000, 'IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_CONFLICT', 1; THROW; END CATCH; SELECT (SELECT r.run_id AS runId, CONVERT(datetimeoffset(7), r.admitted_at) AS admittedAt, CONVERT(bit, CASE WHEN r.admitted_at < @before THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS replayed, @operation AS operation, @namespace_id AS namespace, JSON_QUERY(@input, '$.admission') AS admission FROM @r r FOR JSON PATH, WITHOUT_ARRAY_WRAPPER) AS value;"},"resultColumn":{"op":"literal","value":"value"},"input":{"op":"path","path":""}}}}}}
platform bind admit-api-run-live-register
platform: generic-capability-invocation.v1
